{"text": "pd\n\nOFFICE CORRESPOND)\n120 PARK AVENUE, NEW YORK, N.Y. 10017\n\nTO: Marc S. Firestone DATE: August 30, 1994\nSteve Parrish\nJim Sandman\n\nFROM: Charles R. Wall\nRE: \u2018Board Seminar\n\n\u2018After talking with Murray we have agreed on the following rehersal\ndates for the seminar:\n\n\u2018Thursday, September 15 2:30-5:30\nWednesday, September 21 _9:30-1230\nFriday, September 23 9:30-12:30 (if necessary)\n\nMurray would like to review our scripts on Wednesday, September 14. If possible\nwe should have our slides ready for the rehersal on the 15th.\n\nSteve should have the film of the reconstituted tobacco process for his\npresentation on cigarette manufacturing. I understand that he will ask Ken\nFloughton to help with his presentations on cigarette manufacturing (I. on the\nattached outline) and The Cigarette of the Future (IX. on the attached). Ken should\n\nbe present for the rehersals.\n\nI would like to talk with Mare about his addiction outline. I understand Marc\nwill ask Dr. Ciraulo to assist him. Dr. Ciraulo should also be present for the\n\nrehersals.\n\n\u2018The seminar is scheduled for Wednesday, September\n\nce: Murray H. Bring\n/attachment\n\nezoserevoz",
